    {
      "question": "e-3377",
      "field": null,
      "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
      "old_sha256": "2c6eb0e3dd422b542831d28b74b06595aae04c0be243d63a009acd0c74ebf284",
      "new_sha256": "22fa67c7df39cc5e47e72856aa75c45eb829e4af5aa9d72fca2ae6b890a37db0",
      "category": "ma_capture",
      "authoring": [],
      "source": [
        {
          "question": "e-3377",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
          "value": "The directional derivative $g'_{\\mathbf u}(a,b)$ of a function $g(x,y)$ at the point $(a,b)$ in the direction of the vector $\\mathbf v$ is given by\n\n$$\ng'_{\\mathbf u}(a,b) = \\nabla g(a,b)\\cdot\\mathbf u\n$$\n\nwhere $\\mathbf u$ is a unit vector in the direction of $\\mathbf v.$\n\nFirst, we find the direction vector and the corresponding unit vector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB} & =\u27e81,4\u27e9-\u27e80,1\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e81,3\u27e9 \\\\ u & =\\frac{\\overset{\\to }{AB}}{\u2016\\overset{\\to }{AB}\u2016} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{1}^{2}+{3}^{2}}}\u27e81,3\u27e9 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}\u27e81,3\u27e9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we calculate the gradient $\\nabla g(x,y)$ and evaluate it at the point $A(0,1)\\mathbin{:}$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\u2207g(x,y) & =\u27e8\\frac{\u2202}{\u2202x}(3{x}^{2}+4xy),\\frac{\u2202}{\u2202y}(3{x}^{2}+4xy)\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e86x+4y,\\,4x\u27e9 \\\\ \u2207g(0,1) & =\u27e86\\cdot 0+4\\cdot 1,\\,4\\cdot 0\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e84,0\u27e9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the directional derivative is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}_{u}^{\u2032}(0,1) & =\u2207g(0,1)\\cdot u \\\\  & =\u27e84,0\u27e9\\cdot \u27e8\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}},\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{10}}\u27e9 \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{10}} \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\sqrt{10}}{10} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\sqrt{10}}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
          "category": "ma_capture",
          "file": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069662/example-3377.json",
          "file_sha256": "4b5d0ce2f6dac2876855391d7dad8b4e7ca965fdf5d6157c9b9717f539e87849"
        }
      ],
