          "question": "e-3382",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Consider the function $g (x, y) = \\ln \\left(\\sqrt {xy^3}\\right).$ What is the rate of change of $g$ at the point $\\left(\\dfrac 12, \\dfrac 32 \\right)$ in the direction in which the function increases most rapidly?",
          "category": "ma_capture",
